# Leave unset in dev: the app calls /api on its own origin and Vite proxies it
# to the backend (vite.config.ts). Only set this if the API is on another origin.
# VITE_API_URL=

# Grafana Faro (websitePlan.md §14.7): browser errors, Web Vitals and API
# traces. Unset = off, and the SDK isn't even bundled. Production: the Faro
# collector URL from Grafana Cloud (public by design). Locally, only with the
# optional receiver: `docker compose --profile faro up -d alloy` in backend/,
# then VITE_FARO_URL=/faro/collect (Vite proxies /faro to it, vite.config.ts)
# VITE_FARO_URL=
# Shown as the app version in Faro, e.g. the git sha.
# VITE_APP_VERSION=
